{"id":"perf_8f43d8743adc2d49","projectId":"event_b4ff141f9800f75f","title":"一个人的古典时光的折痕·于渊&匡俊宏长笛与吉他二重奏音乐会","city":"上海","venue":"上海大剧院","hall":"中剧场","startTime":"2026-08-23T11:30:00.000Z","endTime":"2026-08-23T13:10:00.000Z","weekday":"周日","dateLabel":"08/23","timeLabel":"19:30","price":"¥100 - ¥380","priceTiers":[100,380],"description":"他们是国际赛场的“华人之光”，更是彼此欣赏的室内乐搭档。 匡俊宏是慕尼黑ARD音乐大赛古典吉他组最高奖获得者，而于渊则是柏林音乐厅管弦乐团终身长笛首席，第九届神户国际长笛大赛第一名。于渊的长笛搭配匡俊宏的吉他，它们的音色一个清透如风，一个温暖如绒，天然具有“对话”的质感。本场音乐会以 “时光的折痕” 为线索，选取六部风格迥异的作品，两位演奏家在旋律、节奏与和声中，刻下不同年代、不同地域、不同心境的音乐印记。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://www.shgtheatre.com/shtheatre/index.html#/ticket/detail/22491","sourceName":"上海大剧院官网","sourceUrl":"https://www.shgtheatre.com/shtheatre/index.html#/ticket/detail/22491","scrapedAt":"2026-08-10T10:28:32.754Z","performers":["匡俊宏长笛"],"composers":["舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94"],"program":[{"composer":"舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","title":"舒伯特：阿佩乔尼奏鸣曲","confidence":"official","id":"program_83ca156cac9ead5c","workId":"work_ac7d464993035c0b"},{"composer":"舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","title":"——中场休息——","confidence":"official","id":"program_73454b9393c931ea","workId":"work_16d545a0dd5705d5"},{"composer":"舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","title":"马里奥·卡斯特尔诺沃-泰德斯科：小奏鸣曲（为吉他与长笛而作）","confidence":"official","id":"program_36d66f1919a7d9ed","workId":"work_b523a61320515d62"},{"composer":"舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","title":"文子洋：虹桥机场 2013","confidence":"official","id":"program_48fcf96ef4910583","workId":"work_da52bfd376c0b968"},{"composer":"舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","title":"皮亚佐拉：探戈的历史节选：咖啡馆 1930，夜总会 1960","confidence":"official","id":"program_4b3c80be6ee7cd1b","workId":"work_640e9c6e890ebc16"}],"tags":["舒曼：三首浪漫曲 op.94","音乐会"],"dataQuality":"scraped","sources":[{"sourceId":"shanghai-grand-theatre-official","sourceName":"上海大剧院官网","sourceRecordId":"evt_nplaqc","sourceUrl":"https://www.shgtheatre.com/shtheatre/index.html#/ticket/detail/22491","ticketUrl":"https://www.shgtheatre.com/shtheatre/index.html#/ticket/detail/22491","scrapedAt":"2026-08-10T10:28:32.754Z"}]}